  biomeName: Soft Domes
  minDepthMeters: 2500
  maxDepthMeters: 3000
  shortDescription: Perfect hemispherical mounds under marine snow.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Transition biome. Come here to push deeper, find better materials,
    and work around bowls, pools, and local hotspots.
  commonRewardHook: Reliable value comes from Silica Shards and Copper Ore.
  rareRewardHook: 'The rare pull is real: Electrolyte Salts and Sealant Pack.'
  landmarkIdentity: Soft Domes reads through bowls, pools, domes, and hotspot basins.
    Landmarks should feel large and route-defining.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets exist, but they must be earned by reading the
    terrain.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: localized danger pockets and hostile basins, then
    overstaying for loot. Creature pressure stays low_to_medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Broad sweep collection, light salvage, and scattered node stops.
    Mid-depth: expect basin pockets, salvage traps, and local hotspots, then return
    before greed stretches the route.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is basin lip or dune crest line. This slot
    should read through fan-shaped sediment flows; use bowls and hotspot rims to
    remember loops.
